config LCD_NT7534
	bool "Support NT7534 128x64 monochrome LCD (GPIO SPI)"
	depends on LCD && GPIO
	help
	  Enable support for NT7534 128x64 monochrome LCD driven by
	  GPIO-simulated SPI (Bit-Bang SPI) on BPI-W2 board.
	  This driver does not rely on hardware SPI controller,
	  and can use any free GPIO pins.
